## Example Tor hidden service for WetDrool onion gateway
## Copy to a secure path, adjust, never commit real keys.
##
## 1) Run onion app locally:  cd apps/onion && node scripts/dev-server.mjs
## 2) Or proxy to Vercel production URL via a local reverse proxy on 127.0.0.1:3080
## 3) Start Tor with this config

HiddenServiceDir /var/lib/tor/wetdrool_onion
HiddenServiceVersion 3
# Onion HTTP → local gateway (no JS app)
HiddenServicePort 80 127.0.0.1:3080

# Optional: only allow this service
# SocksPort 0
# ControlPort 0

## After start, hostname file:
##   cat /var/lib/tor/wetdrool_onion/hostname
## Publish that .onion (or link from wetdrool.com/onion once live).
